# Build context for apps/{api,web,ai-service}/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# Allowlist: those Dockerfiles only COPY from their own apps/<name>/ directory.
# Everything else (thesis checkpoints, models, reports, backups, deploy/.env) stays out.
*
!apps/api/
!apps/web/
!apps/ai-service/

# Host-built dependencies and caches must not reach Linux images
# (apps/web/node_modules on a Mac contains darwin-arm64 binaries).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/.vitest-cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/venv
apps/api/bin
apps/api/tmp
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets and local env files never belong in an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
